# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 as ruled (round 3 DY): a supplier's dynamic answer gives the place its first value in the birth tick, and each later change is a push delivered the next tick, which is owed; ch. 9's forwarding (re-emission at host/[p]/0).
test a_dynamic_answer_pushes_next_tick

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="change")
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="first")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click

tick 2
  changed:
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="second")
